      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## SD 1.5 baseline\n\nThe classic `CheckpointLoaderSimple` text-to-image graph, kept because it is the\npath a default workflow and the pod's `COMFYUI_MODEL` checkpoint use. The checkpoint is the\nenv-sourced `v1-5-pruned-emaonly-fp16.safetensors` (COMFYUI_MODEL_URL/SHA256), fetched before\nthe server starts; 512x512, 20 steps, cfg 7.5.\n\nUse it to prove the basic path \u2014 an empty\n`widgets_values` on a LoadImage or a missing checkpoint shows up here first."
      ]
    }
